guarded agent steps; every instance on its diagram;
one inbox; no definition runs without a second approver;
standards foundations DN-01 to 04, 09 to 11

M3 Agentic depth, compatibility, 1.0
29 Mar to 21 May 2027
offline evaluation of agent changes;
governed process changes; frozen API;
unsupported standards refused by name, no CMMN

Gate: ADR-0011, ADR-0014 accepted;
every M1 feature has a SPEC statement;
